T` “aborted” server messages during disruption journeys. No retry was needed.\\n- Full database project skipped because database Jest suites do not import or execute this Playwright-only helper/spec scope; full Playwright exercises the live database-backed journeys.\\n- Build skipped because Next production compilation excludes `e2e/**` and `__tests__/**`; no application, runtime, or build input changed.\\n- Migration proof skipped because no schema or migration changed.\\n- Dependency audit skipped because package files are unchanged.\\n- Container scan skipped because image, standalone, and sanitizer paths are unchanged.\\n- Rendered UI review remains not applicable because all changes are test/harness-only.\\n\\nFinal integrity:\\n\\n- Worktree remains exactly 3 modified plus 2 untracked intended files.\\n- No staged or committed branch diff.\\n- `HEAD` and `main` remain `01a6738e6916c7615c31cb3ae5eafbadedd4b154`.\\n- `git diff --check` passed.\\n- `.next` was removed.\\n- Port 3000 is free.\\n- Playwright teardown reported no data leak.\\n- PostgreSQL and Mailpit remain healthy.\\n- Verification changed no status-reported file.\\n\\n\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
