esults/ui-review/issue75-refund-phone-390x844-refund-retry-succeeded.png)\\n- Tablet: [cancellation success](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-tablet-768x1024-refund-succeeded.png), [failed/focus](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-tablet-768x1024-refund-failed-retry-focus.png), [busy](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-tablet-768x1024-refund-retry-busy.png), [retry success](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-tablet-768x1024-refund-retry-succeeded.png)\\n- Desktop: [cancellation success](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-desktop-1440x900-refund-succeeded.png), [failed/focus](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-desktop-1440x900-refund-failed-retry-focus.png), [busy](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-desktop-1440x900-refund-retry-busy.png), [retry success](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-desktop-1440x900-refund-retry-succeeded.png)\\n\\nIntegrity:\\n\\n- Only `travel_app_refund_settled_test` was used.\\n- Cleanup verified zero review users, refunds, and refund attempts.\\n- Server stopped; port 3000 is free.\\n- Git status remains exactly 12 modified and four untracked intended paths.\\n- No source or status-reported file was changed.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/verifier\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
