{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:52:45.818Z","ordinal":19852,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a00845-78fa-7c21-b664-1acd45bb3111","author":"/root/ui_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/ui_review\nPayload:\nThrowaway Playwright fallback used because browser plugin tooling was unavailable.\n\nActionable findings: none.\n\nAt 390x844, 768x1024, and 1440x900:\n\n- Exact cancellation copy rendered: `Booking cancelled. Any refund due will appear in the status column.`\n- That message owned focus as a polite `role=\"status\"` with computed 3px solid amber outline, 3px offset, and 5px halo.\n- The durable status column truthfully showed `$960 refund sent.`\n- DB-forced `FAILED` showed `$960 refund needs attention.` and keyboard-reachable `Retry Refund`.\n- Delayed retry rendered `Retrying refund…`, disabled the button, set `aria-busy=\"true\"`, and announced `Retrying your $960 refund.`\n- Completion focused the live `$960 refund sent.` status with the amber treatment.\n- Exactly one booking remained with preserved `FAILED` and new `SUCCEEDED` attempts.\n- Client width equaled scroll width throughout.\n- No refund-journey console errors, page errors, request failures, or HTTP 500 responses occurred. The unchanged chart components still emit their previously noted zero-size Recharts development warning.\n\nEvidence:\n\n- Phone: [cancellation](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-phone-390x844-refund-succeeded.png), [failed/focus](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-phone-390x844-refund-failed-retry-focus.png), [busy](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-phone-390x844-refund-retry-busy.png), [success](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-phone-390x844-refund-retry-succeeded.png)\n- Tablet: [cancellation](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-tablet-768x1024-refund-succeeded.png), [failed/focus](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-tablet-768x1024-refund-failed-retry-focus.png), [busy](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-tablet-768x1024-refund-retry-busy.png), [success](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-tablet-768x1024-refund-retry-succeeded.png)\n- Desktop: [cancellation](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-desktop-1440x900-refund-succeeded.png), [failed/focus](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-desktop-1440x900-refund-failed-retry-focus.png), [busy](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-desktop-1440x900-refund-retry-busy.png), [success](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-refund-desktop-1440x900-refund-retry-succeeded.png)\n\nIntegrity:\n\n- Only `travel_app_refund_review_test` was used.\n- Cleanup verified zero review users, refunds, and refund attempts.\n- Server stopped; port 3000 is free.\n- Git status remains exactly 12 modified and four untracked intended paths.\n- No source or status-reported file was changed."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
