{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T02:07:52.131Z","ordinal":19979,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_00fb20eee1c75140016a811b72f00c8198a56dd5d5db26eb36","status":"completed","call_id":"call_r82mn1LpB3KAZS4neskk04k2","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: /tmp/travel-app-pr75-refunds.md\\n+## Summary\\n+\\n+- persist the exact refund amount decided by a booking cancellation and link it to immutable cancellation history\\n+- submit Stripe refunds through durable, idempotent attempts with lost-response recovery and concurrency-safe reconciliation\\n+- show customer-safe refund states on the profile page with accessible failure and keyboard retry recovery\\n+- cover database integrity, provider state mapping, leak tracking, cancellation integration, and the paid booking journey\\n+\\n+## Verification\\n+\\n+- `npx tsc --noEmit`\\n+- `npm run lint` (0 errors; 8 existing warnings)\\n+- `npm run test:unit` (808 passed)\\n+- `npm run test:database` (196 passed)\\n+- fresh and populated migration proofs, including refund integrity guards\\n+- `npm run build`\\n+- `npx playwright test` (40 passed)\\n+- rendered cancellation and retry review at 390x844, 768x1024, and 1440x900\\n+\\n+## Scope\\n+\\n+Advances #75. This slice completes cancellation refunds and their customer retry states. The issue remains open for receipts/customer-safe payment history and any broader operational reconciliation tooling.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T02:07:52.496Z","ordinal":19980,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-c97b41ae-3874-4d64-ad33-ee36167bf638","changes":{"/tmp/travel-app-pr75-refunds.md":{"type":"add","content":"## Summary\n\n- persist the exact refund amount decided by a booking cancellation and link it to immutable cancellation history\n- submit Stripe refunds through durable, idempotent attempts with lost-response recovery and concurrency-safe reconciliation\n- show customer-safe refund states on the profile page with accessible failure and keyboard retry recovery\n- cover database integrity, provider state mapping, leak tracking, cancellation integration, and the paid booking journey\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`\n- `npm run lint` (0 errors; 8 existing warnings)\n- `npm run test:unit` (808 passed)\n- `npm run test:database` (196 passed)\n- fresh and populated migration proofs, including refund integrity guards\n- `npm run build`\n- `npx playwright test` (40 passed)\n- rendered cancellation and retry review at 390x844, 768x1024, and 1440x900\n\n## Scope\n\nAdvances #75. This slice completes cancellation refunds and their customer retry states. The issue remains open for receipts/customer-safe payment history and any broader operational reconciliation tooling.\n"}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA /tmp/travel-app-pr75-refunds.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1786846072249,"completed_at_ms":1786846072496}}
