{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T03:16:01.709Z","ordinal":21110,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a812b70833081989de07cc254af9cf6","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The verifier found two real test-design gaps, both in the new migration: direct `CAPTURED` inserts were not durably tested, and the populated-row backfill had only manual proof. I’m adding focused product-behavior coverage for those two paths, killing the corresponding mutants, then I’ll do the one required re-verification pass."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1786850160625,"completed_at_ms":1786850161709}}
